"""
MIP PRO — PHASE 12.2 PART 1
AI CHIEF INVESTMENT OFFICER CORE ORCHESTRATION

Responsibilities
----------------
1. Accept outputs from existing specialist engines.
2. Normalize inconsistent engine payload shapes.
3. Match records by NSE symbol.
4. Assemble Phase 12.1 AI CIO decision-contract payloads.
5. Validate every decision through services.ai_cio_contract.

This module is read-only.

It does not:
- write to the signal repository;
- modify specialist-engine results;
- expose Flask routes;
- alter dashboard behavior;
- restart services;
- rank decisions;
- cache decisions;
- publish decisions.

Ranking, summaries, caching, and comparison mode are added in later
Phase 12.2 implementation parts.
"""

